title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/panel:set
catalog: GUI command
target: panel:set
summary: Change a layout setting (type)

!! Reference

* Defined by the shell (a builtin)

!! Default keys

* ``t b`` → ``panel:set type trash``
* ``t d`` → ``panel:set type metarecord-detail``
* ``t e`` → ``panel:set type log-detail``
* ``t f`` → ``panel:set type file``
* ``t g`` → ``panel:set type message``
* ``t h`` → ``panel:set type help``
* ``t l`` → ``panel:set type metarecord-list``
* ``t m`` → ``panel:set type file-manager``
* ``t o`` → ``panel:set type log``
* ``t r`` → ``panel:set type repos``
* ``t s`` → ``panel:set type shell``
* ``t t`` → ``panel:set type treeref``
* ``t u`` → ``panel:set type duplicates``
* ``t v`` → ``panel:set type recent``
* ``t w`` → ``panel:set type workspace-info``
* ``t y`` → ``panel:set type sync``
